  "architecture": "Production UI may only reference active canonical media records. Legacy V21 plates remain quarantined. Canonical media carry alt text, provenance, rights metadata and source paths. The Explorer client consumes only a frozen server-built read model; canonical catalog/repository remains server-only. Media roles, rights status and explicit media variants are part of the canonical contract. Research graph and migration artifacts are domain-side projections, not client sources of truth."
